  "slides": [
    {
      "id": "pKANdiRRxayi8Nla4t-md",
      "order": 0,
      "layout": "Title",
      "content": {
        "images": [],
        "text": [
          "I've been thinking a lot about why we (or why I, at least) collect certain images.",
          ""
        ],
        "url": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "SnkMppEFrFaEjwR59d8LF",
      "order": 1,
      "layout": "Title",
      "content": {
        "images": [],
        "text": [
          "I spent most of my childhood on the internet. (And the library.) \n\nI loved reading design and architecture and fashion and photography blogs—"
        ],
        "url": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "pXDxKjNYbgAnrfoFlSl0F",
      "order": 2,
      "layout": "Title",
      "content": {
        "images": [],
        "text": [
          "—and collecting all the beautiful, strange, fascinating images I found. \n\nFor many years, I used [Pinterest](https://www.pinterest.com/celinenguyen/) for this. Now I use [Are.na](https://www.are.na/celine-nguyen/channels), which lets me collect quotes and PDFs too."
        ],
        "url": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "dDuqopSA3r4IkafdN_UiI",
      "order": 3,
      "layout": "Title",
      "content": {
        "images": [],
        "text": [
          "I would 'collect' any image that had a strange, obscure allure to it. Images that I couldn't stop looking at."
        ],
        "url": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "A8ReJxvhR27RmEUVhRg7_",
      "order": 4,
      "layout": "Title",
      "content": {
        "images": [
          "https://d2w9rnfcy7mm78.cloudfront.net/22169275/original_11c0f617883b3d9b318247abbd4d4048.jpg?1686205619?bc=0"
        ],
        "text": [
          "Earlier this month, for example, I came across an image that a South Korean graphic designer, [Yanju Jeong](https://www.are.na/block/22169275), had saved to Are.na",
          ""
        ],
        "url": "",
        "comments": [
          {
            "id": "HcfPyL5OoJZY5rREVgVvC",
