    },
    {
      "id": "4eGueUkgla6IgrPQb1Gpt",
      "order": 5,
      "layout": "Image",
      "content": {
        "images": [
          "https://d2w9rnfcy7mm78.cloudfront.net/22169275/original_11c0f617883b3d9b318247abbd4d4048.jpg?1686205619?bc=0"
        ],
        "text": [
          "It's an illustration by the Netherlands-based [Studio Airport](https://www.instagram.com/studio.airport/?hl=en), to accompany Robin Wall Kimmerer's essay '[The Serviceberry](https://emergencemagazine.org/essay/the-serviceberry/)' in *Emergence Magazine*"
        ],
        "url": "",
        "comments": []
      },
      "style": {
        "imageColors": [
          [
            "oklch(0.6354201673816211 0.1141822051847819 15.207523837325963)",
            "oklch(0.35192621564679366 0.08602516769498884 17.508708645627546)",
            "oklch(0.9615119415928823 0.014680785859258751 33.07133054314218)",
            "oklch(0.5819606119347038 0.08009299666142859 16.6846130502126)",
            "oklch(0.4531978476946797 0.040897762011613666 80.80020425484261)"
          ]
        ],
        "customBackgroundColor": "imageColors[0][4]",
        "customPrimaryColor": "imageColors[0][2]"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "v1a6Efgj-Z_zOcXTtkjKX",
      "order": 6,
      "layout": "Title",
      "content": {
        "images": [],
        "text": [
          "After I came across this image online, I pulled out the two copies of _Emergence_ that I own and spent my evening rereading them."
        ],
        "url": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "BU02-BiPHS-xxY6oiclNF",
      "order": 7,
      "layout": "Title",
      "content": {
        "images": [],
        "text": [
          "And then I came back to that image I'd found online."
        ],
        "url": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "Uz5XboktdVTBFJEZRaS6u",
      "order": 8,
      "layout": "Title",
      "content": {
        "images": [],
        "text": [
          "Whenever I find an image that captivates me, that I feel some *affinity* to (as the critic Brian Dillon [might say](https://www.nyrb.com/products/affinities))"
        ],
        "url": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "E_RyOo8FD_15h_X1cwURu",
      "order": 9,
      "layout": "Title",
      "content": {
        "images": [],
        "text": [
          "I want to understand why I'm responding to it. Is it the content? The form? The colors? The composition? What is it about _this specific image_ that is so alluring?"
        ],
        "url": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hUD6kNrfucKiNhdLWZJCw",
      "order": 10,
      "layout": "Title",
      "content": {
        "images": [],
        "text": [
          "It helps to start small—to point to very specific moments in the image.",
          "_An academic might describe this as an exercise in 'close looking'_"
        ],
        "url": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "KnoqcU5KeLfgKh_L_Usm_",
      "order": 11,
      "layout": "Title",
      "content": {
        "images": [],
        "text": [
          "Let's look at this image together—",
          "_(you can hover on the_ ✴︎ _icons to see what I'm noticing)_"
        ],
        "url": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "rFFuVAmLxf5C5fvmRooXt",
      "order": 12,
      "layout": "Image",
      "content": {
        "images": [
          "https://d2w9rnfcy7mm78.cloudfront.net/22169275/original_11c0f617883b3d9b318247abbd4d4048.jpg?1686205619?bc=0"
        ],
        "text": [
          ""
        ],
        "url": "",
        "comments": [
          {
            "id": "FDHa08Ev2cIvXJoC4gkzb",
            "slotIndex": 0,
            "x": 0.22538999462076384,
            "y": 0.10670030724154068,
            "text": "One of the intriguing things about this image is the contrast between\n\n* something very natural, physical, dimensional (the leaves)\n* and something much more flat and constructed (the 2D cutouts)\n\nThe cutouts remind us that we're looking at a photograph of some leaves, not the actual leaves themselves. (As Magritte said, _Ceci n'est pas un pipe_)"
          },
          {
            "id": "kLryeftCWjElJl5lt_Lhk",
            "slotIndex": 0,
            "x": 0.6209355292825015,
            "y": 0.3541213095407655,
            "text": "The cutouts look very natural—slightly uneven edges and a little bit dimensional, like they've been punched out from paper."
          },
          {
            "id": "Iu2_zpd9IO0RMv0jbKmRF",
            "slotIndex": 0,
            "x": 0.8877892932283955,
            "y": 0.860396999742722,
            "text": "You can see these thin white borders—even more evidence they were manually punched out."
          },
          {
            "id": "1FeFBnZNd5zeVe1aGE4vp",
            "slotIndex": 0,
            "x": 0.4949245939675174,
            "y": 0.8022686259345192,
            "text": "The image has a beautiful ying/yang feeling of formality and balance: the left is mostly filled, with the circles creating minute openings and negative space…\n\nand the right is empty, with a profusion of circles in the foreground. (It's also interesting that they're more clustered in the bottom right corner, as if they're a little heavy and have sunken down.)"
          }
        ]
      },
